<title>POLAND: TONSIL REVISES DOWN 1996 NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>TONSIL REVISES DOWN 1996 NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tonsil preliminary</p>
<p>results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    operating				1.30   vs    5.21</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  0.57   vs    1.29</p>
<p>    net					0.19   vs    0.49</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is Tonsil SA. The company</p>
<p>previously reported a 1996 net profit of 0.24 million zlotys, a</p>
<p>pre-tax profit of 0.47 million zlotys and an operating profit</p>
<p>of 1.23 million zlotys.</p>
<p>    net sales			     66.76   vs   57.35</p>
<p>    costs of sales			53.50   vs   43.36</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.00   vs    0.55</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.39   vs    0.80</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.09   vs    0.99</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.82   vs    4.36</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
